error[B0222]: `fail(e)` throws, and nothing here catches a throw
 --> check/fail.bloom:4:21
  |
4 |   if name.isEmpty { fail(Error("No name")) }
  |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not a closure TS calls, nor `catching { … }`
  |
help: return the error: `return err(e)`
